  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Whose: il cui, la cui",
     "texto": [
      "**il cui** (whose, masculine), **la cui** (whose, feminine), **i cui** / **le cui** (whose, plural). It agrees with what follows, not with the owner: **uno scrittore il cui libro è famoso** (a writer whose book is famous).",
      "**Il cui** is followed by the noun."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With a preposition",
     "texto": [
      "**per cui** (for which), **a cui** (to whom), **durante il quale** (during which): **Il progetto per cui ho lavorato** (the project I worked on).",
      "With «il quale», the antecedent is made clearer in long sentences."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
